cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated ASTS study and this repository."
title: "ASTS-cancer-dependency: reproducibility code for the androgen-suppressed transcriptional state study"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/takbaba-lab/ASTS-cancer-dependency"
authors:
  - family-names: "Miao"
    given-names: "Yingqi"
    affiliation: "Kyushu University"
  - family-names: "Baba"
    given-names: "Takashi"
    affiliation: "Kyushu University"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and supporting metadata for construction and evaluation
  of the androgen-suppressed transcriptional state (ASTS), including
  mouse adrenal zona fasciculata RNA-seq processing, cross-species
  signature projection, pharmacogenomic analyses, CRISPR dependency
  analyses, and robustness analyses in human cancer cell lines.
keywords:
  - transcriptomics
  - pharmacogenomics
  - CRISPR dependency
  - cancer cell lines
  - androgen
  - adrenal cortex
  - transcriptional state
